    "name": "Beastkeepers",
    "steam_appid": 3652940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/7326648af2d0cbda22980e7f87836bb7.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Beastkeepers is your creature taming adventure at the bottom of the screen. Breed and train powerful creatures, battle enemies, and earn coins. Use them to unlock new creatures, upgrades, and decorations. Grow stronger and progress endlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.poster.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.webm?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.mp4?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/44b95310a360de33b6951bc373fec9de.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed and Train Unique Creatures:</strong> Nurture, and evolve your creatures into powerful beasts ready for combat. Each creature has its own set of abilities, strengths, and weaknesses. Unlock new creatures as you progress!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/52f7ea3cbe709b5358c8cef7a364d04c.poster.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/52f7ea3cbe709b5358c8cef7a364d04c.webm?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/52f7ea3cbe709b5358c8cef7a364d04c.mp4?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gameplay with Meaningful Progress:</strong> Beastkeepers is designed to be played even when you're not around. While you\u2019re away, your creatures continue to fight and earn coins. Use these coins to upgrade your beasts, improve your land, and unlock new structures to automate your processes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize and Upgrade:</strong> From creature abilities to land decoration, the game allows for a deep customization experience. Place decorative structures to enhance your land and grant passive bonuses that affect your creatures\u2019 stats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/c04f8e4981a399b34630f781b6e7e6af.poster.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/c04f8e4981a399b34630f781b6e7e6af.webm?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/c04f8e4981a399b34630f781b6e7e6af.mp4?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Against Enemies:</strong> Your creatures will fight in automated battles, but you\u2019ll need to strategically train and improve their skills to face tougher opponents. As you defeat enemies, you\u2019ll earn coins and resources to upgrade your monsters and lands.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/7326648af2d0cbda22980e7f87836bb7.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Beastkeepers is your creature taming adventure at the bottom of the screen. Breed and train powerful creatures, battle enemies, and earn coins. Use them to unlock new creatures, upgrades, and decorations. Grow stronger and progress endlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.poster.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.webm?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/ff73763c15fb7da387ccfe300743dccf.mp4?t=1753891133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/44b95310a360de33b6951bc373fec9de.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed and Train Unique Creatures:</strong> Nurture, and evolve your creatures into powerful beasts ready for combat. Each creature has its own set of abilities, strengths, and weaknesses. Unlock new creatures as you progress!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652940/extras/52f7ea3cbe709b5358c8cef7a364d04c.poster.avif?t=1753891133\" width=616 height=250 ><s